= Past exam of the chemistry course of the year 4 of the natural sciences course of the University of Cambridge

Student suggested answers for the past ten years are available on Chemistry Moodle. https://teaching.ch.cam.ac.uk/files/Start%20of%20Term%20Arrangements/Part%20III%20Course%20guide%202025.pdf#page=30[Official course guide: past papers and suggested answers] New solutions for years covered by that archive are skipped; existing wiki drafts are retained.

The held 2015 interdisciplinary papers are also skipped under the https://teaching.ch.cam.ac.uk/files/Examiners%20Reports/External%20Examiners%20reports%202014_15%20redacted.pdf#page=12[2015 departmental policy releasing suggested answers after five years]; applying the Parts III policy to shared IDP1–3 is a scope inference, not an inspected private answer file.

